## Interface: 11200
## Title: Tank Buddy
## Notes: Notices Party/Raid members when you use last stand, shield wall, lifegiving gem, berserk, or when your taunt/growl/mocking blow/holy strike/hand of reckoning/earth shock fails. Can also remove salvation automatically.
## Dependencies:
## SavedVariables: TBSettings
## OptionalDeps: CT_RaidAssist
